### Fatal Accidents by Road Type

This focused bar chart isolates fatal accidents because they are rare and can be visually hidden in stacked severity charts.

![](pics/visualizations/fatal_accidents_by_road_type.png){#fig-fatal-road-type width=85%}


### Traffic Accident Hotspots

This hexbin plot shows spatial accident concentration across the Canton of Zurich using CHLV95 coordinates. The logarithmic colour scale helps show both dense urban hotspots and lower-density road structures.

![](pics/visualizations/traffic_accident_hotspot.png){#fig-accident-hotspots width=85%}

